# ─── Translation server (tools/translation-server/) ──────────────────────────
#
# The extension POSTs to this base + /metadata to extract page metadata.
#
# Auth is per-user JWT — the extension fetches a fresh token from Milton's
# local connector (`POST 127.0.0.1:7521/auth/issue-token`) per save. No
# shared API key is baked into the extension build. See README "Auth flow"
# section for the full pipeline.

# Production (default — TS-5 live since 2026-05-10).
VITE_TRANSLATE_BASE=https://translate.milton.so

# Local dev alternative — bring up tools/translation-server/ via docker compose
# (CADDY_HOST=http://localhost) and point the extension at it.
# VITE_TRANSLATE_BASE=http://localhost
